# PING WIDTH: the delay's bounce on FX I's SEL list (a delay only), after TO FX II; 127 (a new project's) hard left and
# right, 0 the echoes centred. The FX track's filter page has it on its fourth knob too. Kept in the project
wait 300
projnew
expect par11.x1 127
expect par12.x1 127
expect epar11.x1 127
tap FX
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
expect page FX_I
tap SEL
row PING WIDTH
turn ALGO -20
wait 40
shot pingwidth_list.png
tap SEL
wait 40
expect par11.x1 107
expect epar11.x1 107
# FX II is the reverb: no PING WIDTH there
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
expect page FX_II
tap SEL
row LOW-PASS
wait 40
shot pingwidth_fx2.png
tap SEL
# kept by a save, a reboot and the load
projsave 1 pingwidth
reboot
wait 400
expect par11.x1 107
expect epar11.x1 107
